 "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Silk Mesh texture, cut to a ring. A wide band of fine woven metal mesh with neat rolled edges, soft to the eye and flexible on the finger. Pairs with the Silk Mesh Cuff.</p><p><strong>STYLING TIP:</strong> Pair it with the Silk Mesh Cuff in the same metal.</p><p><strong>Details</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Width: Approximately 10mm</li>\n<li>Construction: Fine woven metal mesh with neat rolled edges</li>\n<li>Sizes: US 6, 7 and 8</li>\n<li>Plating: 18k gold tone plated or rhodium plated silver tone (choose above)</li>\n<li>Material: Surgical stainless steel</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><p>Waterproof and tarnish free, so daily wear and water are fine. Keep it away from perfume and harsh chemicals, wipe with a soft dry cloth and store it flat in its pouch.</p><p>You will receive your piece in a Naira Petite box.</p>",
